## Accessibility

### WCAG Compliance

```typescript
// ✅ Always include alt text
<Image src={url} alt="Property exterior view" />

// ✅ Use semantic HTML
<nav>, <main>, <article>, <section>, <aside>

// ✅ Keyboard navigation
<button
  onClick={handleClick}
  onKeyDown={(e) => e.key === 'Enter' && handleClick()}
  tabIndex={0}
>

// ✅ ARIA labels when needed
<button aria-label="Close dialog">
  <X className="h-5 w-5" />
</button>

// ✅ Focus management
<input
  ref={inputRef}
  onFocus={() => setFocused(true)}
  onBlur={() => setFocused(false)}
/>
```

## Key Principles

1. **Tailwind first** - No inline styles, use Tailwind classes
2. **Mobile-first** - Start with mobile, add larger breakpoints
3. **Dark mode** - Always provide dark variants
4. **Lucide icons only** - Consistent icon system
5. **Next.js Image** - For all images
6. **Semantic HTML** - Use proper HTML5 elements
7. **Accessibility** - Alt text, ARIA labels, keyboard navigation
8. **Consistent spacing** - Use Tailwind spacing scale
9. **Custom theme** - Use defined colors and fonts
10. **Component reuse** - Create reusable UI components
